<title>USA: NYMAGIC ups shr buyback plan to $45 mln.</title>
<headline>NYMAGIC ups shr buyback plan to $45 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>NYMAGIC Inc said on Monday its board of directors authorized an increase in the company's share repurchase program to $45 million from $25 million.</p>
<p>The company said it had repurchased about 1.4 million shares with a total price of about $25 million since 1989 through the close of business on December 8.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1710</p>
</text>
